{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14224","headline":"秋砧送邑大夫 · 窦叔向","name":"秋砧送邑大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"断续长门下，清泠逆旅秋。\n征夫应待信，寒女不胜愁。\n带月飞城上，因风散陌头。\n离居偏入听，况复送归舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦叔向","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}